# STRUCTURE: four bats, four city missions and the Caldera. Marseille is
# two stretches of eight screens and the lift; the lab climbs six; the
# listening post has 18 rooms and the Caldera 10; the pass is a script of
# about two minutes before its two bosses; the ring road 26,200 px.
# SAVING: no run is ever saved (as the original); the records are: the
# best scores in Marseille, the Andes and Cairo, and the rescues.
seed 1
game echounit
wait 5
cheat mission 0
wait 3
expect b_mw == 2560
cheat section 1
wait 3
expect b_mw == 2560
cheat section 2
wait 3
expect b_mw == 320
cheat mission 4
cheat section 1
wait 3
expect b_mh == 960
cheat mission 3
wait 3
expect s_rooms == 18
expect s_guards == 17
cheat mission 4
wait 3
expect s_rooms == 10
cheat mission 2
wait 3
expect k_length == 26200
check_songs
# a record is kept; a run is not
cheat mission 2
cheat knospawn
cheat score 900
cheat done
waituntil state == 7 100
expect save_best2 == 900
reload
game echounit
wait 5
expect state == 0
expect save_best2 == 900
expect save_runs >= 1
